WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.866
What cardiac arrest means.

00:00:01.866 --> 00:00:06.099
During cardiac arrest the heart is no longer pumping blood.

00:00:06.099 --> 00:00:14.350
The casualty becomes unresponsive and does not breathe normally; ventricular fibrillation develops in many arrests.
